<p>
  The fresh build starts from nothing: it clears everything a build regenerates - the
  reference store, the error dumps, the harvested examples and the suite results - then
  runs the seven suites and the one crawl that remains, the harvest that gathers the
  reference and the examples from every application. Thousands of fetches, a minute or
  two; the <a href="?index">overview</a> shows the outcome when it lands.
</p>

<p>
  <a href="?build&go=1">Fresh build</a> - there is no undo; everything above is
  regenerated from the applications themselves.
</p>